1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,380
Let us through already!

2
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,840
We need to get to Iroha, so stay out of our way!

3
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:31,220
That's far enough, you traitors!

4
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:34,380
You're interfering with the liberation of all magical girls!

5
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:38,600
Surrender now or else!

6
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,600
Tsukuyo, Tsukasa...

7
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:47,300
M-Mifuyu...

8
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:50,200
Please stop. Fighting is pointless.

9
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:54,300
The Magius' plan... failed.

10
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:56,380
This was wrong from the start.

11
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:59,440
I'm sorry for all of the horrible things I made you do.

12
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:01,840
Wait, what? We can't just stop now!

13
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,980
She's right, what do we tell the others?

14
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:10,060
I'm sorry things got this far...

15
00:01:10,060 --> 00:01:13,760
But we can't hurt anyone else in the name of the Magius.

16
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:17,660
We have to stop. For everyone's sake.

17
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:28,600
Williams is full.

18
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,680
Okay.

19
00:02:48,020 --> 00:03:06,860
Iroha, it's you.

20
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:13,940
Toga!

21
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,380
Gosh, I missed you.

22
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:20,960
And this whole time, I didn't even realize how much I did.

23
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,700
Like I was trapped in a fog and forgot all about you.

24
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,300
I know, but it's okay.

25
00:03:25,820 --> 00:03:29,840
I remembered you and there's no way I was gonna give up till I saw you again.

26
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,520
How could I forget?

27
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:33,240
You're like my big sis.

28
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:35,800
I won't forget you again, ever.

29
00:03:36,340 --> 00:03:37,380
I won't either.

30
00:03:39,260 --> 00:03:40,600
Hello, big sis.

31
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:41,840
We missed you.

32
00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:43,240
It's been too long.

33
00:03:43,540 --> 00:03:44,260
You remember?

34
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:45,460
You do?

35
00:03:45,460 --> 00:03:47,500
Yes, I remember.

36
00:03:48,140 --> 00:03:51,120
I wish I could have told you before, Toga, but I couldn't.

37
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:56,160
By keeping it a secret, it freed you to do things you wouldn't normally have.

38
00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:56,660
Huh?

39
00:03:56,660 --> 00:04:08,860
Take it easy.

40
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:10,600
Calm down, it's okay.

41
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,940
No, it's not.

42
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:15,480
I tried to kill you.

43
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:16,980
You didn't know.

44
00:04:17,340 --> 00:04:20,240
The reason I made a contract was to save you.

45
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:22,300
But then I tried to kill you.

46
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,200
Why?

47
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:24,400
It's fine.

48
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:25,480
See, I'm okay.

49
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,860
Everything's okay now.

50
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:30,420
To put our plan into action, we needed magical girls.

51
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:36,640
So we used Embryo Eve to reach out to the ones suffering the most and drew them to us.

52
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:41,180
Come to Kamehama, where magical girls can be saved from their fate.

53
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,880
No way, that was you guys?

54
00:04:44,140 --> 00:04:50,460
What we didn't expect was that the majority of the girls who made their way to us were much weaker than others.

55
00:04:50,620 --> 00:04:51,120
What?

56
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:56,480
They brought with them all the fears that were too much for them to bear on their own.

57
00:04:57,820 --> 00:05:00,840
Toga decided the Magyus would save these girls.

58
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:04,080
She listened to them, sympathized with them.

59
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:07,340
After a while, she started to change.

60
00:05:08,340 --> 00:05:11,140
Fear, sorrow, anger.

61
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:15,640
Toga fell down a well of misery and there was no getting out of it.

62
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:20,840
At some point, it became too much for her and she snapped.

63
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,900
Alone, we're all weak.

64
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:25,220
But we can be strong if we just hold hands.

65
00:05:26,460 --> 00:05:30,560
Unfortunately, only the ones on the stage could hold hands.

66
00:05:30,980 --> 00:05:31,400
Huh?

67
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:35,720
The sad truth of it all is that the ones who were afraid

68
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:39,800
stayed just out of our reach in the wings stewing in their rage.

69
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:41,480
She's right.

70
00:05:42,060 --> 00:05:44,180
So I turned into their rage.

71
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,540
What are you saying?

72
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,360
The girls who lost hope.

73
00:05:47,980 --> 00:05:49,840
The ones who couldn't protect themselves.

74
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:55,620
Crushed by fear and falling into despair as their souls became more tainted.

75
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:58,940
Saving those magical girls is my job.

76
00:05:59,300 --> 00:06:00,080
My priority.

77
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:04,880
We decided to change how the world specifically worked for us.

78
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:08,100
To save the girls who couldn't join us on stage.

79
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:12,240
Whatever it took, we had to make the doppel system work.

80
00:06:12,780 --> 00:06:13,600
For them.

81
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:17,580
I'm sorry, Roma.

82
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:19,500
I got you into all this.

83
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,340
I tried to kill you.

84
00:06:21,380 --> 00:06:22,300
It's okay.

85
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,600
You didn't mean it.

86
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,560
Everything you did, you did for me.

87
00:06:27,300 --> 00:06:30,740
I can't be mad at you because you rest your lives to save me.

88
00:06:30,740 --> 00:06:34,120
It's all that we wanted, in the end.

89
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,520
And it's what we wanted too, but...

90
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:42,200
The things we put you through, and we didn't even know we were doing it.

91
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:46,420
That's all in the past now.

92
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,680
The important thing is we're together.

93
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:51,540
And together we're going to fix everything that went wrong.

94
00:06:52,260 --> 00:06:53,480
You think we can?

95
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:55,800
What's done is done.

96
00:06:56,260 --> 00:06:58,220
All that matters is what we do next.

97
00:06:58,780 --> 00:06:59,300
Yeah.

98
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:00,980
Yeah, you're right.

99
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,720
All right then.

100
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:09,660
But if we're going to make things right,

101
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:12,780
there's something I need to clear up for myself first.

102
00:07:13,620 --> 00:07:14,100
Nemu?

103
00:07:15,020 --> 00:07:15,980
What is it?

104
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:19,920
You knew everything this whole time, so why didn't you tell me?

105
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:21,980
I'm sorry, Toka.

106
00:07:21,980 --> 00:07:23,660
I don't want your sorries.

107
00:07:23,940 --> 00:07:25,620
I want to know why you didn't tell me.

108
00:07:26,220 --> 00:07:27,860
When our plan failed,

109
00:07:28,340 --> 00:07:31,900
I extracted Ui's soul and transferred it to Kyubei's body.

110
00:07:32,580 --> 00:07:33,620
But by doing that,

111
00:07:34,140 --> 00:07:36,660
Ui's existence was cut off from this world.

112
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:40,480
That meant all traces of her disappeared from here.

113
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:43,720
Everything, including your memories of her.

114
00:07:44,460 --> 00:07:46,300
The same happened to Iroha.

115
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:49,680
She forgot about us and our friendship with her,

116
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:52,480
because we were connected to her through Ui.

117
00:07:53,420 --> 00:07:55,380
When I realized what happened,

118
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,800
I almost gave up on everything.

119
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:02,880
I thought I lost the things in this world that were precious to me.

120
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:05,660
But there was hope.

121
00:08:06,180 --> 00:08:08,100
Even though you couldn't remember, Ui,

122
00:08:08,180 --> 00:08:09,580
you kept the plan going.

123
00:08:10,940 --> 00:08:14,620
Somehow, you found a righteousness you didn't have before.

124
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:17,220
You gave the girls hope again.

125
00:08:17,860 --> 00:08:18,700
And me too.

126
00:08:19,380 --> 00:08:22,240
You made me believe the plan wasn't dead.

127
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:24,000
I see.

128
00:08:24,380 --> 00:08:26,380
You didn't tell me because you were worried.

129
00:08:26,900 --> 00:08:29,480
You thought if I knew the truth about everything that happened,

130
00:08:29,620 --> 00:08:30,720
I'd abandon the plan.

131
00:08:31,060 --> 00:08:31,540
Yes.

132
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:34,800
So, as long as I didn't remember anything,

133
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:35,980
it was better for you.

134
00:08:36,300 --> 00:08:37,380
Is that what you thought?

135
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:38,380
I did.

136
00:08:38,920 --> 00:08:39,740
How could you?

137
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:42,420
I'm sorry.

138
00:08:43,520 --> 00:08:46,500
But I couldn't let anything get in the way of the plan.

139
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:50,760
Now that your memories are back and you know the truth,

140
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:53,000
what do you want to do?

141
00:08:54,060 --> 00:08:55,040
Iroha's visits.

142
00:08:55,500 --> 00:08:56,520
The lunches she'd bring.

143
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,360
Laughing.

144
00:08:57,860 --> 00:08:58,180
Playing.

145
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,860
That hospital room was my whole world.

146
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,700
Mine too.

147
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:07,280
Those were the happiest, most precious times in my life.

148
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:11,700
Having those memories back makes me feel like I can do anything.

149
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:14,140
I know I can.

150
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:16,080
I feel the same.

151
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,440
We have nothing left to lose now.

152
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,300
I know, Iroha.

153
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:25,800
She wouldn't just stand by and let someone sacrifice themselves to save her.

154
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,160
Same for Ui.

155
00:09:28,820 --> 00:09:30,400
She wouldn't want that either.

156
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,020
But that's where you and I come in.

157
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,920
We have nothing to lose.

158
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:37,700
We can make it happen for them.

159
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,840
You were right to keep things secret.

160
00:09:41,060 --> 00:09:44,380
You had no idea what I'd do about the plan once my memory came back.

161
00:09:44,900 --> 00:09:48,400
I was a risk and hiding the truth was the only way to stay on course.

162
00:09:48,580 --> 00:09:49,960
You had no other choice.

163
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:52,600
I am sorry, Toka.

164
00:09:53,140 --> 00:09:56,680
I hated doing it and I was terrified I was making a mistake.

165
00:09:56,680 --> 00:10:00,080
But thanks to you, I know what must be done.

166
00:10:01,020 --> 00:10:07,700
No matter how wrong we may have been, let's finish the plan so Ui's sacrifice doesn't go to waste.

167
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:08,660
Hang on.

168
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:09,880
Go to waste?

169
00:10:09,980 --> 00:10:11,320
What are you guys talking about?

170
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:15,000
We made a promise with Ui and we're gonna keep it.

171
00:10:15,460 --> 00:10:18,060
Even if it's not exactly what Ui would want.

172
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,120
Agreed.

173
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,700
The two of us will finish what we started.

174
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:22,940
You gotta be joking.

175
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:25,500
After everything, you're gonna keep going?

176
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:26,980
Of course we are.

177
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:31,480
If we can finish the doppel system, we can change the fates of all magical girls.

178
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:33,300
But the doppel system doesn't work.

179
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:35,040
It doesn't save anyone in the end.

180
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:38,200
Either your doppel takes you over or you turn into a witch.

181
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:42,660
I'll admit the current doppel system has a few flaws that need correcting.

182
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:46,200
But once we do that, it should work as intended.

183
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:50,000
Naturally, there'll be a few sacrifices along the way.

184
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:56,540
But if that's what it takes to liberate magical girls and end their cycle of despair, we're okay with that.

185
00:10:59,940 --> 00:11:01,400
What are you doing?

186
00:11:01,540 --> 00:11:06,000
When the city's destroyed, that should keep you safe from the shockwave of the blast.

187
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:08,720
Please don't do this! You can't be okay killing people!

188
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:10,780
You know this is wrong! It's evil!

189
00:11:11,100 --> 00:11:14,420
You can't talk us out of it. We know what we're doing and why.

190
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,220
We'll take full responsibility.

191
00:11:16,900 --> 00:11:19,840
Listen to me! I know you'd never do something so horrible!

192
00:11:20,180 --> 00:11:24,820
When we're finished and you eventually wake up, all of the horrible stuff will be over.

193
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,620
No, don't! You can't!

194
00:11:26,700 --> 00:11:29,940
We failed once, but there's still a chance to make things right.

195
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:31,880
Stop ignoring me and listen!

196
00:11:32,260 --> 00:11:33,640
There's still a chance.

197
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:34,740
We have Ui!

198
00:11:35,060 --> 00:11:35,460
Listen!

199
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:38,540
Good night, big sis. Hope you sleep well.

200
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:39,980
Don't do this!

201
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:56,200
Now then, let's get to work and fix our mistake.

202
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:58,660
We're gonna keep our promise.

203
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:02,000
The one we made with Ui when we all became magical girls.

204
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:10,520
Magical girls have been forced to suffer tragedy and cruelty, but we'll change that story.

205
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:16,800
The Magius will liberate them and change the horrible ending to a happy one.

206
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:18,320
Attention, sisters.

207
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:26,520
The Magius is ready to awaken Embryo Eve and complete the Doppel system.

208
00:12:26,520 --> 00:12:34,760
Once we've deployed the system across the world, magical girls won't have to worry about their souls being taken over by it.

209
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:41,380
And they will never have to live with the fear of becoming a witch ever again.

210
00:12:41,380 --> 00:12:45,840
It's time for us to come together and make our voices heard.

211
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:48,580
Join us and cry out with your rage!

212
00:12:48,580 --> 00:12:54,300
No one will say our sacrifice is meaningless.

213
00:12:54,300 --> 00:12:58,440
Our sacrifice is one of pride and purpose!

214
00:12:58,440 --> 00:13:19,560
zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz....

215
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:21,860
Now what?

216
00:13:23,780 --> 00:13:27,320
That energy blast, it disrupted my emotions.

217
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:30,800
What's going on now?

218
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:33,260
I feel so horrible.

219
00:13:33,940 --> 00:13:35,760
We're all suffering.

220
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:38,200
What's the point?

221
00:13:38,620 --> 00:13:41,640
No matter what I do, nothing's ever gonna be enough.

222
00:13:49,560 --> 00:14:07,200
Hang in there.

223
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:09,280
Whatever you do, don't summon your doppel.

224
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:11,280
Why is this happening?

225
00:14:11,880 --> 00:14:12,960
It's Embryo Eve.

226
00:14:13,260 --> 00:14:14,240
They awakened it.

227
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:15,740
It's that thing?

228
00:14:15,740 --> 00:14:19,280
But we were told it was gonna save us, not hurt us.

229
00:14:19,560 --> 00:14:22,640
The system's malfunctioning, and I'm pretty sure I know why.

230
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:26,480
There weren't enough witches to power it, which made it go berserk.

231
00:14:26,980 --> 00:14:30,860
This will cause the younger magical girls with unstable souls a lot of pain.

232
00:14:31,700 --> 00:14:33,660
Not to mention these poor girls.

233
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:38,520
Katie!

234
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:39,660
Careful!

235
00:14:39,660 --> 00:14:52,500
I couldn't live without Yachiyo.

236
00:14:53,500 --> 00:14:54,800
I'll bury her.

237
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:56,820
Felicia!

238
00:14:57,460 --> 00:14:58,860
What's the point?

239
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:01,380
No one cares if I'm alive anyway.

240
00:15:03,380 --> 00:15:05,340
Finally, we are one.

241
00:15:05,340 --> 00:15:07,340
They don't need anyone.

242
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:08,600
Get each other.

243
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:13,280
Why is this happening?

244
00:15:14,160 --> 00:15:16,740
The doppels are taking over the girls' souls.

245
00:15:18,140 --> 00:15:20,100
Like Kaede's dead.

246
00:15:24,300 --> 00:15:25,580
Another surprise.

247
00:15:25,580 --> 00:15:34,400
Valpurgisnacht is back on its original course, and heading straight from Itakihara.

248
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,960
It's not too far yet.

249
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:38,020
Perfect.

250
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:40,340
We'll head for the city and catch up to her.

251
00:15:40,860 --> 00:15:43,620
Once we do, we'll combine her with Embryo Eve.

252
00:15:49,780 --> 00:15:51,280
Embryo Eve's getting away.

253
00:15:51,860 --> 00:15:53,220
We have to stop it.

254
00:15:53,220 --> 00:15:55,420
What about them?

255
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:03,480
Go after them.

256
00:16:04,060 --> 00:16:05,420
I can handle these girls.

257
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:06,600
Hurry up now.

258
00:16:06,740 --> 00:16:07,820
Don't let them get away.

259
00:16:08,740 --> 00:16:09,440
Are you sure?

260
00:16:10,140 --> 00:16:11,980
I'll keep them all safe and protected.

261
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:14,580
Don't you worry about me.

262
00:16:14,940 --> 00:16:15,920
I'm strong enough.

263
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:21,060
Alright, I'll go after them.

264
00:16:21,060 --> 00:16:25,820
I know you'll take good care of everyone here, but keep yourself safe too.

265
